# Agent and service state. Each folder's own .gitignore keeps its contents out;
# anything else here is ignored, so a new folder stays out too. This rule is here
# and not in the root .gitignore, so that Menagerie's go-git matcher skips the
# folder and does not read a .gitignore inside it.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/claude/
!/codex/
!/pi/
!/t3/
!/workflows/
